{
  "description": "proposed change of use to B2 for a motorcycle class 1&2 MOT garage. Currently B8 for storage. Unit sits adjacent to both a class 4 car MOT garage and a car body shop, which are currently family operated. Unit is emptied now and intended to be refurbished with MOT/service equipment, a small partition wall inside to function as an office/reception, and sufficient ventilation/extraction, so not undertaking structural work. Although the alleyway behind the shopfronts is shared across the units, this is solely for motorcycles so will only be parked inside the unit without disrupting access for anyone else. Due to the location being directly next to other automotive businesses, I think this is a suitable and fair change. Works are pending as DVSA MOT application would require this change.",
